	<name>עודד - ויאטנם</name>
	<visibility>0</visibility>
	<description>Must Do:

Ha Long Bay (Cruise)
Hoi An
Sun World Ba Na Hills
Grand World Ha Noi
Bến Thuyền Tam Cốc (Ninh Binh)

Apps:
GetYourGuide
Grab
DSVN (רכבת דרך דפדפן)
Ve Tau (רכבת דרך אפליקציה)</description>
